{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>發佈時間：14:04 2026-07-04 HKT</p>\n\n<p>「百億富三代」鍾培生（Derek）在今年3月在無預警情況下，宣布向「最年輕區議員」莊雅婷求婚成功，鍾培生在其淺水灣鍾家大宅以「電影級規格」打造《進擊的巨人》場景的求婚儀式，迅即在網上瘋傳，甚至一度成熱話。莊雅婷與鍾培生婚後孕味濃，不過夫婦二人未有公布好消息。</p>\n<p>今日（4日 ）鍾培生逾2萬呎巨型卡牌基地7月開幕，鍾培生宣布即將成為爸爸，太太莊雅婷挺着巨肚撐場，得天獨厚的莊雅婷長胎不再肉，手腳纖細容光煥發，兩人合照難掩笑意。</p>\n<img alt=\"鍾培生今年3月向「最年輕區議員」莊雅婷求婚成功。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b290a25e49005c5ef7a92e90bcaf38a8/2026-03/642814659_18562790707029260_1675585603346574169_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鍾培生與莊雅婷一同展示新婚戒指。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1df8f347658f9b4b49e45d534943a42b/2026-03/angel_cnt_1774701933_3862801889343678633_1417343010.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"莊雅婷與鍾培生婚後已見孕味 。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/bb7e6d72a9d26479fecb6f78dcde46f0/2026-04/thumbnail_10__5.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"莊雅婷變水桶腰。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/e9f1a82842c97d29f7dc476b9382118d/2026-04/thumbnail_8__6.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"見莊雅婷側面腹部微隆，仲要着平底鞋。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/470d46c5eb460f442949e98efd366bc0/2026-04/thumbnail_11__7.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鍾培生表明若有小朋友也不會讓孩子見報。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/f7e49880e94a8b01769cce55c0ad7195/2026-04/thumbnail_1__16.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"日前鍾培生為媽媽慶祝生日。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/285ba86ff0289166cbb29951302b48a9/2026-05/001_0_35.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"有「港姐畫家」之稱的朱潔儀晚有份出席。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d3207385b7052661584cc533b4c49f07/2026-05/002_0_39.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"事後大晒慶祝相片。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0810dd4ea2afbb0a4a7309d55304ca3d/2026-05/003_11.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"穿上粉紅色的恤衫配長褲現身的莊雅婷腰肢圓潤，鬆身打扮難掩孕味極濃的腹部。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d0cf720d97a209cfe9ea2b68d1c8ebd2/2026-05/004_15.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鍾培生大晒老婆為他整的魚翅撈飯，兼大嗌多謝老婆。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b2085d7b8fbeec6a5c2a7cfd0d65d69b/2026-05/111_2_.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"鍾培生最近宣布在尖沙咀開設佔地2.2萬呎、號稱是全球最大卡牌基地「HKTCG」。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/abf7ccf0b58fc4f0a574d4791c364127/2026-05/111_3_.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"鍾媽媽亦有落場幫手。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c465e2e04843624b51f69629c3903960/2026-05/111_1_.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"鍾培生的父親是豪華廈置業執行董事鍾仁偉。  ​\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/df3455dd9e569e4366f5a5d213b6328f/2023-03/khdcheung_275872336_724595302036223_5624826938785701028_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鍾培生有百億「富三代」之稱。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/bb838cf23f159985729d5dd0899ccfd6/2023-03/khdcheung_270936021_3117716835170347_7774046251736751665_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鍾培生一向喜歡分享家中的名物，例如跑車。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8114ca3aa45d82315a918a847f41480e/2023-03/khdcheung_134518460_702320143817145_4898529149269390304_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鍾培生求婚成功後首帶未婚妻莊雅婷現身活動。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/b78cb1dc649d1c7161efefb3d677b1c1/2026-03/WhatsApp_Image_2026-03-06_at_9_09_46_PM_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"莊雅婷戴上巨型求婚鑽戒。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/f42ebd9ecc686d307b56039179dfc050/2026-03/WhatsApp_Image_2026-03-06_at_9_09_46_PM_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鍾培生和莊雅婷互動被網民分析。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/0cc363a6ab699f7f38c718e7835776b3/2026-03/WhatsApp_Image_2026-03-06_at_9_09_46_PM_3_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"有網民從「行為心理學」角度分析，指莊雅婷在影片中出現「身體防禦」。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/4ddd2c77f5e3d195bd55f637f5cf78e3/2026-03/WhatsApp_Image_2026-03-06_at_9_09_48_PM_3_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"網民認為兩人互動生疏，引來鍾培生反擊。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/87dd3a9a610aa0e60dfde5767aff46ca/2026-03/WhatsApp_Image_2026-03-06_at_9_09_48_PM.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鍾培生更直接將另一條在活動中拍攝的影片上傳到IG。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6d74771590d37664c7ff0eadecd087c4/2026-03/1_2_18.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"似乎是想以行動證明與莊雅婷是兩情相悅。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5da18ce1d47b5d969e5914e04fc62025/2026-03/2_5_7.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"有力地反擊了外界的揣測。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/73a9fd7dadc8b6d010f5bbd448665b8a/2026-03/3_5_6.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"力證二人感情甜蜜。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/49d373bd57743bb57aba0fbcb186f9a4/2026-03/4_4_16.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鍾培生展示「低調式」炫富。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8f91e83504a5302b898fbe354d3f6928/2026-03/v2.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"影片中，鍾培生與Ayumi在其停泊多部黃色法拉利的車庫前大擺Pose。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/05fb668cce747b390b3326bd5686cde1/2026-03/v3.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鍾培生更邀Ayumi入萬呎豪宅內接受專訪。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b219b21a81b63153f0263676f5dfc27d/2026-03/n1.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"內部裝修以簡約白色為主調，樓底極高。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/aa51f18bc4b70a5e0bd5f58fd3776ae0/2026-03/n2.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鍾培生屋企，連天台地庫總共有5層。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3f9662e54a196bcdb20f58eb7c239e12/2023-03/photo1677758803.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"有私家車房。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/87249cf9e4b9c9d18a518697ae95b603/2023-03/photo1677758803%20%281%29.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"門口相當巨型。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c7d4ac75c2aae01f76b21e4b88a9bd9f/2023-03/photo1677758803%20%282%29.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"客廳的傢俬真係點擺都得。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/69fc016c879b46fab9959dcd3be0a356/2023-03/photo1677758803%20%284%29.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"每款傢俬都後精緻。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/72a574d92af987e603c5adcb10d260c6/2023-03/photo1677758803%20%286%29.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"每款傢俬都後精緻。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/068e9249d91685ba3534ad050c37be9e/2023-03/photo1677758803%20%287%29.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"花園大到可以擺放一個標準拳擊擂台。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4e410b00f3c22dad11ba771d7a2f68f2/2023-03/photo1677758803%20%2810%29.jpeg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-04T06:18:17.513978+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":237,"images":36,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"unknown"}}